From: lavender-droidspaces-ksu buildfix
Subject: [PATCH] drm/vkms: gem fault 回调改用 vm_fault_t 返回类型

4.17 起 vm_operations_struct.fault 的返回类型从 int 改成了 vm_fault_t
（= unsigned int），而这棵树自带的 vkms 还是旧签名，clang 以
-Werror,-Wincompatible-function-pointer-types 拒绝编译：

  vkms_drv.c:32: error: incompatible function pointer types initializing
  'vm_fault_t (*)(struct vm_fault *)' with an expression of type
  'int (struct vm_fault *)'

只改函数的返回类型（定义 + 声明）；函数体返回的 VM_FAULT_* / 0 本来就
是 vm_fault_t 的合法取值，语义不变。

这是「启用 DRM_VKMS 以提供 renderD128 渲染节点」这一步的配套修正
（anland 的 Chroot/LXC 路径把该节点当 control_fd 用）。
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_drv.h | 2 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_gem.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_drv.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_drv.h
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_drv.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_drv.h
@@ -63,6 +63,6 @@ struct drm_plane *vkms_plane_init(struct vkms_device *vkmsdev);
 
 /* Gem stuff */
-int vkms_gem_fault(struct vm_fault *vmf);
+vm_fault_t vkms_gem_fault(struct vm_fault *vmf);
 
 int vkms_dumb_create(struct drm_file *file, struct drm_device *dev,
 		     struct drm_mode_create_dumb *args);
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_gem.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_gem.c
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_gem.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/vkms/vkms_gem.c
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@ static void vkms_gem_free_object(struct drm_gem_object *obj)
 	kfree(gem);
 }
 
-int vkms_gem_fault(struct vm_fault *vmf)
+vm_fault_t vkms_gem_fault(struct vm_fault *vmf)
 {
 	struct vm_area_struct *vma = vmf->vma;
 	struct vkms_gem_object *obj = vma->vm_private_data;
